From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Witold=20Gre=C5=84?= <witold.gren@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:00:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ws, rtsp: record watched live views to mp4 files

While an RTSP client watches a camera whose recording is switched on, the
frames it gets are muxed as they come (no transcoding) into a fragmented mp4
at <record_dir>/<camera>/<YYYY-MM-DD>/HHMMSS-HHMMSS.mp4. One recording per
camera at a time. The switch (ws command record_live) is a file in
record_switches, the state carries record_live and recording_live.
---
